**Status Check**:
-->  It is a health check performed by AWS to make sure your EC2 instance and the AWS infrastructure are working properly.

two main status check:
1. system status check:
--> AWS infra
    ---> AWS physical host
    ---> networking
    ---> power
    ---> Hypervisor
    ---> AWS hardware

2. instance status check
--> instance itself
    ---> OS not responding
    ---> kernel problems
    --> network issue

3. EBS reachability

    2/2 check pass : all ok
    1/2 check pass: system issue --> stop and start the instance
    0/2 check pass: system + instance --> reboot instance

